        <a href="https://www.fanniemae.com/about-us/corporate-governance/fannie-mae-charter" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fannie Mae history ↗</a>
      </div>
      <p class="fine-print">Historical data are subject to revisions and differences in index construction. The home-price chart uses FHFA national All-Transactions HPI fourth-quarter values, 1975–2025. The mortgage-rate chart uses annual averages for every calendar year from 1971 through 2025, calculated from Freddie Mac PMMS weekly observations (1971 begins in April). The 1942–2025 annual decline count is from the Shiller-based series linked above. Educational information only; not a forecast or investment recommendation.</p>
